From: Daniel Casota <dcasota@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Patch11006 (7.x): canister type isolation - no task_struct/lock types in any canister object

Linux 7.3-rc4 port of the Photon FIPS canister series.
See EXPERIMENTAL-7.3-rc4-FIPS.md for the per-patch decisions.
---
diff --git a/arch/x86/crypto/aesni-intel_glue.c b/arch/x86/crypto/aesni-intel_glue.c
